      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "jun",
          "text": "Doesn't the database still get hammered?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sen",
          "text": "A cache tier sits in front. Memcached, plus TAO, a graph cache for follows and likes."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sen",
          "text": "Over ninety-five percent of reads never reach the database."
